{"track":"r","category":"함수·재귀","level":3,"title":"함수 합성","desc":"<p>두 함수 <code>f</code>, <code>g</code>를 받아 <b><code>f(g(x))</code>를 계산하는 새 함수</b>를 돌려주는 <code>compose(f, g)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","solution":"compose <- function(f, g) {\n  function(x) f(g(x))\n}\n","hint":"<p>R에서도 함수는 값이라서 인자로 받고 돌려줄 수 있어요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"compose(function(x) x + 1, function(x) x * 2)(5)","expected":11,"visible":true},{"call":"compose(as.character, abs)(-3)","expected":"3","visible":true},{"call":"compose(nchar, as.character)(12345)","expected":5,"visible":false},{"call":"compose(function(x) x, function(x) x)(9)","expected":9,"visible":false}],"starter":"compose <- function(f, g) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-346"}